# [PROJECT NAME]

## Project Overview
- **Type**: .NET MAUI mobile application
- **Platforms**: iOS, Android
- **Language**: C# (.cs) and XAML (.xaml)
- **Framework**: .NET [VERSION]

## Architecture
- MVVM pattern (ViewModels + XAML Views)
- Pages in `[PAGES_PATH]`
- Shared modules in `[MODULES_PATH]`
- Tests in `[TESTS_PATH]`

## Code Standards
- **C# files**: PascalCase for classes, methods, properties. camelCase for local variables
- **XAML files**: Consistent indentation, use x:Name for named elements
- **ViewModels**: Inherit from BaseViewModel, use INotifyPropertyChanged
- **Navigation**: Shell navigation
- **Async**: Use async/await, never block with .Result or .Wait()

## Common Commands
| Command | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `dotnet build` | Build solution |
| `dotnet test` | Run tests |
| `dotnet restore` | Restore NuGet packages |

## Rules
- Never hardcode API keys, passwords, or connection strings
- Always use SecureStorage for sensitive data
- Handle null checks on all API responses
- Use try-catch on all async service calls
- XAML bindings must match ViewModel property names exactly
